    "marguerite": {
      "at": "2026-10-16T08:40:00Z",
      "take": "Ambitious, and a clever bet: engineered microbes are the sort of platform that could be patented and monetised, though I'd want to see the economics before I believed a single word about Mars.",
      "valence": 0.6,
