    "tobias": {
      "at": "2026-10-16T09:05:00Z",
      "take": "Quite a lot of ambition for one world, and I'd sooner we looked after the one we've got before we go remaking another.",
      "valence": -0.6,
      "intensity": 0.4,
      "topics": ["terraforming", "mars", "novelty"]
    },
    "desmond": {
      "at": "2026-10-16T09:25:00Z",
      "take": "Right, so, clever people wanting to make a dead planet fit to live on, while there are families in this country who can't get a decent place to rent, and I'd like to see that same energy go there first.",
      "valence": -0.2,
      "intensity": 0.3,
      "topics": ["space", "housing", "science"]
    },
    "ingrid": {
      "at": "2026-10-16T09:40:00Z",
      "take": "Ja, a whole planet as a prototype, built from microbes nobody has tried yet? I'm already sketching the dye bath, and I'm a bit jealous it isn't mine.",
      "valence": 0.8,
